---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Empower Volleyball Club</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Empower Volleyball Club has concluded operations." />
    <meta name="robots" content="index, follow" />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://empowervb.com/" />

    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://empowervb.com/" />
    <meta property="og:title" content="Empower Volleyball Club" />
    <meta property="og:description" content="Empower Volleyball Club has concluded operations." />
    <meta property="og:image" content="https://empowervb.com/images/logo/empower-logo-og-image.png" />
    <meta property="og:image:alt" content="Empower Volleyball Club" />

    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
    <meta name="twitter:url" content="https://empowervb.com/" />
    <meta name="twitter:title" content="Empower Volleyball Club" />
    <meta name="twitter:description" content="Empower Volleyball Club has concluded operations." />
    <meta name="twitter:image" content="https://empowervb.com/images/logo/empower-logo-og-image.png" />

    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/images/logo/favicon.svg" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/images/logo/favicon.png" />
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/images/logo/apple-touch-icon.png" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#1C1F4C" />

    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@500;600&family=Poppins:wght@400;500&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <style is:global>
      :root {
        --navy: #1c1f4c;
        --coral: #ff7f50;
        --lilac: #c8a2c8;
        --muted: #525252;
        --page-bg: #f7f5f7;
        --card-bg: #ffffff;
      }
      *,
      *::before,
      *::after {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }
      html,
      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }
      body {
        min-height: 100vh;
        background-color: var(--page-bg);
        background-image:
          radial-gradient(circle at 18% 20%, rgba(200, 162, 200, 0.18), transparent 45%),
          radial-gradient(circle at 82% 80%, rgba(255, 127, 80, 0.12), transparent 50%);
        color: var(--navy);
        font-family: 'Poppins', system-ui, sans-serif;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 2.5rem 1.25rem;
        -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
      }
      main.page {
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 620px;
      }
      article.card {
        background: var(--card-bg);
        border-radius: 20px;
        padding: 3rem 2.75rem;
        box-shadow:
          0 1px 3px rgba(28, 31, 76, 0.06),
          0 24px 60px -12px rgba(28, 31, 76, 0.14);
        text-align: center;
      }
      .logo {
        display: block;
        max-width: 300px;
        width: 78%;
        height: auto;
        margin: 0 auto 1.75rem;
      }
      h1 {
        font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 1.75rem;
        line-height: 1.3;
        color: var(--navy);
        margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
        letter-spacing: -0.01em;
      }
      .accent-line {
        width: 56px;
        height: 2px;
        background: var(--coral);
        border-radius: 2px;
        margin: 0 auto 1.75rem;
      }
      .body-copy {
        text-align: left;
      }
      p {
        font-size: 1rem;
        line-height: 1.75;
        margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
        color: var(--navy);
      }
      p:last-of-type {
        margin-bottom: 2.25rem;
      }
      .cta-wrap {
        text-align: center;
      }
      a.cta {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: baseline;
        gap: 0.4rem;
        font-family: 'Poppins', system-ui, sans-serif;
        font-weight: 500;
        font-size: 1rem;
        color: var(--navy);
        text-decoration: none;
        border-bottom: 1.5px solid var(--coral);
        padding-bottom: 4px;
        transition: color 180ms ease, border-color 180ms ease;
      }
      a.cta .arrow {
        color: var(--coral);
        transition: transform 180ms ease;
        display: inline-block;
      }
      a.cta:hover {
        color: var(--coral);
        border-color: var(--navy);
      }
      a.cta:hover .arrow {
        transform: translateX(4px);
      }
      a.cta:focus-visible {
        outline: 2px solid var(--coral);
        outline-offset: 4px;
        border-radius: 2px;
      }
      footer.credit {
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 0.8125rem;
        color: var(--muted);
        margin-top: 1.5rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.02em;
      }
      @media (max-width: 480px) {
        article.card {
          padding: 2.25rem 1.5rem;
          border-radius: 16px;
        }
        .logo {
          max-width: 240px;
          width: 82%;
        }
        h1 {
          font-size: 1.5rem;
        }
        p {
          font-size: 0.9375rem;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="page">
      <article class="card">
        <img
          class="logo"
          src="/images/logo/empower-logo-horizontal-full-color.svg"
          alt="Empower Volleyball Club"
        />
        <h1>Thank you for the season.</h1>
        <div class="accent-line" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="body-copy">
          <p>
            Empower Volleyball Club has concluded operations. With gratitude to the
            families who took a chance with us — we hope each player carries forward the
            values we set out to build this club around.
          </p>
          <p>
            For families seeking a club that holds to those same values, we recommend
            Adversity Wisconsin Volleyball Club, led by Dave Pauers.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="cta-wrap">
          <a class="cta" href="https://www.adversitywisconsin.org">
            Visit Adversity Wisconsin
            <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>
      <footer class="credit">© Empower Volleyball Club</footer>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
